Vulkan: build the pipelines of queued draws ahead (#378). When a draw needs a pipeline that does
not exist yet, walk the commands already queued behind it on shadow registers and start building
every missing pipeline at once on the creation threads. The idea is ReGPU's
(https://github.com/zer0ducksgiven/ReGPU, MIT, renderer.cpp GpuLookahead).

